# Active Ed25519 plugin signing keys — PUBLIC material, safe to commit.
# One 64-hex Ed25519 public key per line. Lines starting with '#' are comments.
#
# Bootstrap: dologctl plugin keygen signing.key
#   → put the seed into the DOLOGGER_PLUGIN_SIGNING_KEY GitHub secret
#   → commit the printed public key (64 hex) here.
# Then the release workflow signs official bundles with that key and any
# loader configured with this store verifies them as BLUE trust.
#
# Rotation: add the new key below, commit, and (after the grace window)
# move the old key's fingerprint to revoked.txt with reason "superseded".
#
# v0.0.1 ships no signed plugins, so this file is intentionally empty.
